              "value": "Earthquake Stomp"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Frequency: 1/round\n\nThe ironclad annihilator beetle stomps the ground. All creatures within a 30-foot emanation must succeed at a 44 Fortitude saving throw or fall prone and become stunned 1 (stunned for 1 round on a critical failure)."
